# 2026-09-02: every value below is now `${VAR:-default}` instead of a plain assignment. The script
# sources this file BEFORE applying its own `${VAR:-...}` defaults, so a plain assignment here
# silently CLOBBERED any env override — `UE_ROOT=... ./ue-avp-build.sh device` appeared to work and
# quietly cooked against ue581-port instead. That is how you ship a build that looks right and is
# built from the wrong engine (cf. the 2026-08-22 SM6 cook that silently ran ES3_1 for days).
# Pinchwork (My_Project) — ue-avp-build.sh config. Build against OUR fork explicitly (bypass the GUID assoc).
# CHIP-pinchwork-msaa-shadows 2026-08-23: moved from the 5.6.1 fork root to the port/visionos-5.8.1
# worktree, which carries the MSAA+movable-shadow fix (see ue581-visionos-msaa-with-movable-light-shadows).
#
# D23, 2026-09-03 — decision record: ~/knowledge/intelligence/decisions/2026-09-03-one-golden-trunk-avp-openxr.md
# Default repointed to the ue582-xr-main-m5 worktree. The previous default,
# .claude/worktrees/ue581-port, DOES NOT EXIST — not on disk, absent from `git worktree list`, which
# shows only the retired 5.6.1 trunk root and ue582-xr-main-m5. The default pointed at nothing, so any
# lane relying on it failed outright. ue582-xr-main-m5 is UE 5.8.2, the golden line per
# ~/knowledge/intelligence/decisions/2026-08-28-xr-main-is-the-golden-ue-line.md, and carries the
# deferred translucent depth-fixup (c8842998bf87). The 5.6.1 trunk root is RETIRED and carries a
# RETIRED-DO-NOT-BUILD.md marker after a build ran against it on 2026-09-03 and lost 2h57m.
UE_ROOT="${UE_ROOT:-/Users/Shared/GH/UnrealEngineVisionOS/.claude/worktrees/ue582-xr-main-m5}"
PROJECT="${PROJECT:-/Users/Shared/GH/RevivrStudios-Polyarc-PSVR2-VisionOS-Sample/My_Project.uproject}"
TARGET="${TARGET:-My_Project}"
CLIENTCONFIG="${CLIENTCONFIG:-Development}"
SIM_UDID="${SIM_UDID:-A540B3B5-CB1D-477D-A3B9-A6D41598B704}"
# BUNDLE_ID left blank → auto-detected from the packaged .app (BundleName=Pinchwork)
